Workaround for hiero-sdk-tck v0.11.0 node-service tests on multi-node networks.
NodeCreateHandler.preHandle requires the node account's key to sign (INVALID_SIGNATURE
otherwise), and account 0.0.4 is a genesis node account on multi-node deployments
(ACCOUNT_IS_LINKED_TO_A_NODE). This patch makes the tests sign with their fixture
account's key and use that account instead of the hardcoded 0.0.4.
Candidate for an upstream hiero-sdk-tck fix; drop once released.

